{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>52歲男星劉愷威自今年單身後火速迎來新戀情，近日被捕獲與32歲女友黎紀君在深圳商場高調拍拖放閃。兩人全程毫不避忌地展現親密互動，一身黑白情侶裝打扮更是吸引眾人目光。這段相差20年忘年戀在人前展現出令人意想不到甜蜜狀態。</p>\n<p>52歲男星劉愷威自今年單身後火速迎來新戀情，近日被捕獲與32歲女友黎紀君在<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/travel/%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E5%95%86%E5%A0%B42024-%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95%E5%95%86%E5%A0%B4-%E6%8E%A8%E4%BB%8B-js02-1465752/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">深圳商場</a>高調拍拖放閃。兩人全程毫不避忌地展現親密互動，一身黑白情侶裝打扮更是吸引眾人目光。這段相差20年忘年戀在人前展現出令人意想不到甜蜜狀態。</p>\n<h2>劉愷威黎紀君深圳商場高調放閃</h2>\n<p>近日有網民在深圳一間商場野生捕獲熱戀中劉愷威與黎紀君。相中清晰可見男方頭戴黑色Cap帽配襯黑色上衣，女方則以全白休閒服裝示人，完美配搭出低調且合襯黑白情侶裝。兩人在逛街期間互動非常自然鬆弛，女方不僅單手推着行李箱緊隨男友身旁，更在商場人群中甜蜜挽住男方手臂同行。其後兩人一同前往餐廳用膳兼各自玩手機，相處狀態猶如老夫老妻般融洽自在。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488772934319122_14622303676afbd031ef30c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261116113437245-1116_00862_001_03p.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488772934319122_14622303676afbd031ef30c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG相片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>父親劉丹對未來新抱開綠燈支持</h2>\n<p>其實這段戀情曝光後，兩位當事人已經毫不避忌大方認愛，並對外透露雙方是因為熱愛打匹克球與網球而在球場上擦出愛火。對於兒子迅速展開新一段關係，向來着緊家人父親劉丹亦大方開出綠燈。劉丹早前公開回應傳媒時表示非常盼望能盡快見面，更以「同聲同氣」形容這位未來新抱，女方成功在未正式入門前獲得男方家長高度認可及祝福。</p>\n<h2>告別李曉峰火速投入新一段戀情</h2>\n<p>回顧男方過去數年感情史，自2018年與內地女星楊冪正式離婚後，其私生活動向一直備受外界高度關注。直到今年4月，他與另一內地女星李曉峰低調處理感情悄然畫上句號，宣告重返單身行列。沒想到分手短短數月後，他便透過運動結緣火速與年輕20年新歡秘密撻着，隨着兩人感情逐漸穩定，約會模式亦由地下情轉為公開高調放閃。</p>\n<h2>網民直擊十指緊扣留言大讚甜蜜</h2>\n<p>這次商場約會照片在網絡上流出後隨即掀起大批網民熱烈討論。不少親身目擊兩人互動網民紛紛在社交平台發文分享現場細節，有人直接留言指出兩人「一路上十指緊扣」。同時亦有大批網民將焦點放在他們日常相處狀態上，紛紛留言大讚「十分甜蜜」，並形容雙方互動自然不造作，在公眾場合展現出「感情相當穩定」一面。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488773050158838_901020406afbd0331d0f5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261116113437245-1116_00862_001_06p.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488773050158838_901020406afbd0331d0f5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488773180688796_12785626226afbd034c4419.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261116113437245-1116_00862_001_04p.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488773180688796_12785626226afbd034c4419.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488773341551073_13086060316afbd035ea443.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261116113437245-1116_00862_001_05p.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488773341551073_13086060316afbd035ea443.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488773474883730_21430755296afbd03719305.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261116113437245-1116_00862_001_08p.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488773474883730_21430755296afbd03719305.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179247305725017593_12283288216ad6f7e189797.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"5i0j-5Iv5CieIGzYhrV5ap0XK4ifEr9xppWIEaaViBE.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179247305725017593_12283288216ad6f7e189797.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG相片）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179247305551942579_2771954016ad6f7dfc1db1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"W3L50QUc79y4okG6nzsm3WfiXuRMArncYZUdQGGVHUA.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179247305551942579_2771954016ad6f7dfc1db1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>與劉愷威因匹克球而相識（圖片來源：IG@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T04:07:49.492447+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1214,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T03:55:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T04:01:26.436145+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T04:01:26.436145+00:00","content_hash":"3b2f5509584f1298691b8d201e5bf52a93b901dd479eadc8d756024bdf02e8de","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}